{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"何西阿書","commonName":"何西阿書","title":"何西阿書","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"1390c0b166f5f648615cbddd0fc0981a1b1280f32e03791ade9afbe66f074180","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":14,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["悔改帶來祝福"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"以色列啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你被自己的罪惡絆倒了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"歸向你的上帝耶和華吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要歸向耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向祂懺悔說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「求你赦免我們一切的罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"施恩悅納我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好叫我們以讚美為祭獻給你！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞述不能救我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們不再依靠戰馬，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不再稱自己所造的神像為我們的上帝。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為孤兒在你那裡才能得到憐憫。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我要醫治他們的叛道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心甘情願地愛他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我的怒氣已經轉離他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要像甘露一樣滋潤以色列，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他綻放如百合花，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"扎根如黎巴嫩的香柏樹。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他要長出嫩枝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他要像橄欖樹一樣榮美，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如黎巴嫩的香柏樹一般芳香。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他要歸回，住在我的蔭下。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他要茂盛如五穀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"榮美如葡萄樹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聲名遠揚如黎巴嫩的美酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"「以法蓮啊，我與偶像有何關係？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我應允你的禱告，看顧你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我像一棵青翠的松樹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的果實都來自於我。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"讓那些智者明白這一切，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓那些明哲瞭解這一切。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華的道是正道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"義人要行走在上面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"罪人卻在上面跌倒。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/14.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOL/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/13.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}